  message: "Resolved in PR #703 (merged, dev 90b7a2b10c). NON-REPRODUCED under 6-way concurrency (cpu_count=6): 2x pretix (88 ARs) + 6x caddy (72 ARs) surveys -> 0 passes varied in files_analyzed (filing claimed 18/84 — a signal 8 runs would catch). MECHANISM CLOSED STRUCTURALLY: the per-pass concurrent os.walk race is gone — file discovery routes through the shared, sorted discovery.FileIndex (single os.walk at startup, deterministically ordered, get_file_index/set_file_index), so every pass sees the same stable file set. Added the regression GUARD (test_files_analyzed_is_deterministic_across_runs): pipeline 3x on a multi-language + Flask-route + DB-execute fixture (concurrent analyzers + the scan-heavy route/db linkers the filing named), assert files_analyzed identical per pass — passes. HONEST LIMIT: a fast small-fixture guard can't reproduce a scale/timing race, so the primary evidence is the 8-run real-repo non-reproduction + the FileIndex mechanism; the guard locks it forward."  # a629
